[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4328961806","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118911#issuecomment-4328961806","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118911","id":4328961806,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAga3Dg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T17:09:16Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T17:09:16Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4328961806/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329354196","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118911#issuecomment-4329354196","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118911","id":4329354196,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAgyz1A","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T18:05:19Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T18:05:19Z","body":"I didn't have time to test or review this; I just noticed a mistake in the files changed when I glanced at them.\r\n\r\nThis PR has some issues:\r\n\r\n1. The bug in the screenshot feature has nothing to do with HDR output. It has to do with the existing HDR 2D setting that was introduced in 4.3. This bug has existed for a long time, likely.\r\n2. This PR does not fix the issue that has existed for a while when HDR 2D is enabled.\r\n3. When HDR 2D is enabled, Request HDR output is enabled, and \"Save HDR screenshots\" is disabled, this produces an invalid PNG file that can't be opened in any image viewer that I have on my computer.\r\n\r\nThis is the PNG that is produced by the configuration that I just described in point 3:\r\n![editor_screenshot_2026-04-27T140231](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f00c031-cd22-4b3c-ba38-204e54591f3c)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329354196/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4329376331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118911#issuecomment-4329376331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118911","id":4329376331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAg0KSw","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-27T18:09:18Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T18:09:18Z","body":"A lot of this can be fixed in a followup PR, but my gut tells me that it would be a lot nicer on everyone to revert this for the time being so we aren't rushing trying to fix the issues this PR introduces/doesn't fix.\r\n\r\nI think the \"Save HDR screenshots\" menu option needs more discussion before adding this feature to Godot. I personally think saving EXR screenshots from the editor is bloat that the editor doesn't need. I don't see what problem it is solving. Instead, the original issue that has existed with HDR 2D setting should probably simply be fixed in a completely new PR with no regard to HDR output or saving EXR files."